# MemHouse CODEOWNERS
#
# Purpose: the core team owns every path in this repository, and the
# security-, tenancy-, audit-, ledger-, pipeline-, release-, migration-, and
# automation-sensitive paths are called out again so they keep a named human
# reviewer if ownership is ever narrowed.
#
# This file only takes effect once "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled
# on the branch protection rule for main. The presence of the file is not
# evidence that the rule is on.
#
# Some patterns below match directories that do not exist yet. That is
# intentional: they claim the path in advance, so a future
# lib/memhouse/policies/ cannot land without the named reviewers.

# Core ownership for every path. Keep this before narrower rules; GitHub uses
# the last matching pattern, so each sensitive override repeats the core owner.
* @memhousehq/core

